{"title":"QT Qonference 2026","startsAt":"2026-11-18T08:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-19T17:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**QueerTech presents [QT Qonference 2026 (QTQ)](https://next.brella.io/join/qtq26/tickets)**[ ](https://next.brella.io/join/qtq26/tickets)**— Canada’s largest 2SLGBTQI+ tech conference!**\n\nIn 2026, QTQ returns to Toronto for two days of in-person programming centred on one of the most urgent questions shaping our future...*Who Gets to Trust AI?*\n\nAs artificial intelligence transforms how we work, hire, build, and govern, QTQ 2026 brings together leaders, professionals, founders, investors, and community members to examine the systems behind AI—and the choices shaping its future.\n\nThis year’s theme — Power, Participation & Accountability — explores:\n\n* Who is building AI systems\n* Who is included in shaping them\n* Who benefits from them\n* And who is responsible when they fail\n\nQTQ 2026 is the flagship gathering of QueerTech’s QT Inclusive AI initiative—a national effort to ensure AI is built responsibly, equitably, and with our communities in mind.\n\nAcross two days, QTQ will create space to:\n\n* Advance inclusive AI conversations in Canada\n* Build careers, companies, and partnerships\n* Connect talent with opportunity\n* Strengthen leadership and accountability in tech\n* Celebrate 2SLGBTQI+ impact across the innovation economy\n\nEarly bird pricing is available until July 5th. Save 30% until then with the code: **[EarlyQTQ26](https://next.brella.io/join/qtq26/tickets)**.\n\n**[View the schedule to get your tickets!](https://next.brella.io/join/qtq26/tickets)**","venue":{"name":"550 Bayview Ave, Toronto, ON M4W 3X8","address":"Evergreen Brick Works - in front of Sweet Petes/Bike Works, Toronto","lat":43.653225,"lng":-79.383186,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"QueerTech Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/b/4/a/highres_534883850.jpeg"}